- **Inconsistency between debrief and performance.** The debrief demonstrates sophisticated understanding of subtext, psychological safety, and systemic issues—none of which were applied during the actual roleplay. This suggests the participant can analyze emotional intelligence retrospectively but struggles to apply it in real-time.
